  <h1>In Search Of</h1>
  <div class="detail-text">
    <p>I&rsquo;ve collected military artifacts for over 30 years and am always interested in connecting with veterans, their families, and fellow collectors.</p>

    <p>My current focus is post-9/11 U.S. Army Special Forces and related special operations material, particularly items with a personal history or connection to the individual who used them.</p>

    <p>My interests extend beyond this period, and I&rsquo;m always interested in unusual pieces with interesting histories.</p>

